  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A Heavenly Court immortal who knows her sighs that she is still so impatient. Others watch with surprise: she is gentle and kind normally, but once she enters battle she acts as the rumors say. She chases the eight Eastern Sea Gu Immortals while shouting vulgarities without stop. Qing Yue An turns to fight her. Qin Song, the most senior among these immortals, orders them to reinforce Little Whip; even she is his junior. Central Continent’s immortals charge together. More than ten starlight pillars then bring Heavenly Court rank eights against Western Desert Immortal Gu Houses rushing toward Emperor City. She charges again. She is a rank eight Gu Immortal and cannot destroy an Immortal Gu House instantly. She is a transformation path Gu Immortal. She transforms into a walking meat tree, roots moving like legs, branches turning into countless whips that attack in a frenzy, and forces several rank seven Immortal Gu Houses to turn and escape. Fang Di Chang notes that experts like her appeared, unlike the previous life.",
      "chapters": [
        1924
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
