        "char_fang_di_chang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Her body is plump to its limit. She is a fat female immortal, like a meat cannonball when she charges.",
      "chapters": [
        1924
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The walking meat tree charges at the front and resists Immortal Gu Houses singlehandedly. Narration calls her a rank eight expert slumbering in the Heavenly Court immortal graveyard. She collides with Dong clan’s rank seven Immortal Gu House Red River Wheel, loses hundreds of fleshy tentacles, and still wants to charge again. Zhang Fei Xiong tells her to go back and heal. She refuses. A giant pillar of starlight covers her and returns her to Heavenly Court against her will. Pale blue strands wrap her in a healing formation. After the round she is almost healed completely.",
      "chapters": [
        1925
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
